{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const createForm: CreateFormHook;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/solid-form/src/createForm.public.ts#L62","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/solid-form/src/createForm.public.ts:62"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Solid form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\nreactive owner."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass an options accessor. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":" establish the initial state and\ninferred form value type, while signals read by the accessor update the same\nform instance when they change. The form is cleaned up when its owner is\ndisposed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = createForm(() => ({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  }))\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(event) => {\n        event.preventDefault()\n        void form.handleSubmit()\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Solid form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst createForm: CreateFormHook;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-form/src/createForm.public.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/solid-form/src/createForm.public.ts#L62)\n\nCreates a Solid form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\nreactive owner.\n\nPass an options accessor. `defaultValues` establish the initial state and\ninferred form value type, while signals read by the accessor update the same\nform instance when they change. The form is cleaned up when its owner is\ndisposed.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ProfileForm() {\n  const form = createForm(() => ({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  }))\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(event) => {\n        event.preventDefault()\n        void form.handleSubmit()\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Returns\n\nThe Solid form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createForm\ntitle: createForm\n---\n\n```ts\nconst createForm: CreateFormHook;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-form/src/createForm.public.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/solid-form/src/createForm.public.ts#L62)\n\nCreates a Solid form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\nreactive owner.\n\nPass an options accessor. `defaultValues` establish the initial state and\ninferred form value type, while signals read by the accessor update the same\nform instance when they change. The form is cleaned up when its owner is\ndisposed.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ProfileForm() {\n  const form = createForm(() => ({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  }))\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      onSubmit={(event) => {\n        event.preventDefault()\n        void form.handleSubmit()\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Returns\n\nThe Solid form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached.\n"}
